name tex-locale
category Package
revision 48500
shortdesc Localisation support for TeX and LaTeX documents
relocated 1
longdesc This package uses both tracklang and texosquery to look up the
longdesc locale information from the operating system and provide
longdesc commands that can access locale-dependent information, such as
longdesc the currency symbol and decimal separator. The file
longdesc tex-locale.tex provides generic TeX code. The LaTeX package
longdesc tex-locale.sty can additionally load babel or polyglossia with
longdesc the locale's language setting, as well as various other
longdesc packages such as fontspec (XeLaTeX/LuaLaTeX) or fontenc +
longdesc inputenc (pdfLaTeX).
runfiles size=23
 RELOC/tex/generic/tex-locale/tex-locale.tex
 RELOC/tex/latex/tex-locale/tex-locale-encodings.def
 RELOC/tex/latex/tex-locale/tex-locale-scripts-enc.def
 RELOC/tex/latex/tex-locale/tex-locale-support.def
 RELOC/tex/latex/tex-locale/tex-locale.sty
catalogue-ctan /macros/generic/tex-locale
